    {
      "text": "自定义车辆、武器与战斗载荷，击败Boss解锁新车和零件",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Customize your car. Choose loadout to fit your combat style. Slap some stickers on. Earn new cars and parts by beating bosses .",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1920430/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "没有加载画面或快速旅行，以车辆连续穿行无尽程序生成荒漠",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "No loading screens. No fast travel. Just use your car. Slow down after the fight, go for a ride and inhale the FUMES . Get lost in the desert. Wander endless, procedural environments.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1920430/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "好友直接加入单人世界，合作所得战利品与进度同步保留到单人档",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Invite your friends to your single-player world. Join up as many friends as your hardware can handle (Steam allows 250 max but you need NASA PC for that). All loot and progress earned together is also saved to single-player .",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1920430/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
